{"video":"z_PI77viuBw","lines":[{"t":[0,2.5],"en":"- Sabre is changing everything."},{"t":[2.5,5.7],"en":"Sight blockers, they don't let us use cups."},{"t":[5.7,7.5],"en":"So I started thinking, who could handle this?"},{"t":[7.5,9.3],"en":"Who would know what to do?"},{"t":[9.3,10.6],"en":"David Wallace would know what to do."},{"t":[12.4,14.4],"en":"What should I do, David Wallace?"},{"t":[14.4,16.1],"en":"- I don't know, well, what can you do?"},{"t":[16.1,18.1],"en":"- Mm, exactly."},{"t":[18.1,19.1],"en":"What are you thinking?"},{"t":[20.3,21.2],"en":"- It's a tough one."},{"t":[21.2,22.6],"en":"- It is a tough one."},{"t":[22.6,24.1],"en":"- I don't have any ideas for you there."},{"t":[24.1,26.9],"en":"- Yeah, but one would be good."},{"t":[27.7,29.1],"en":"- Hey, oh, okay."},{"t":[29.1,30.6],"en":"- Wait. - Okay."},{"t":[30.6,32.9],"en":"- I want to tell you about a business idea I have."},{"t":[32.9,33.9],"en":"- Okay. - Okay."},{"t":[33.9,36],"en":"- You know how kids leave their toys everywhere?"},{"t":[36,37.2],"en":"- Okay."},{"t":[37.2,39.1],"en":"- So this is a vacuum."},{"t":[39.1,40.4],"en":"It's like a shop vac type of thing."},{"t":[41.6,45.2],"en":"Teaches kids how to pick up their own toys, right?"},{"t":[45.2,48.7],"en":"Baseball gloves, hacky sacks, drumsticks."},{"t":[50.8,51.7],"en":"Picks it up."},{"t":[51.7,53.8],"en":"- So the kid's making the noise to pick it up?"},{"t":[53.8,56.6],"en":"- No, no, no, no, that's the vacuum noise."},{"t":[56.6,58.1],"en":"- Oh, okay."},{"t":[58.1,59.5],"en":"- So you don't like it."},{"t":[59.5,60.5],"en":"- No, I think it's--"},{"t":[60.5,61.8],"en":"- No, no, no, it's okay."},{"t":[61.8,63.9],"en":"Another guy from Dunder Mifflin, Arnie from Research,"},{"t":[63.9,65.4],"en":"he's gonna drop the prototype."},{"t":[65.4,66.5],"en":"- Mm-hmm."},{"t":[66.5,68],"en":"- And, uh."},{"t":[68,69.1],"en":"- It's like a shop vac."},{"t":[69.1,70.2],"en":"- Mm-hmm."},{"t":[70.2,71.4],"en":"- They say that?"},{"t":[71.4,72.2],"en":"- Yep."},{"t":[74.7,76.4],"en":"- It'll be okay."},{"t":[76.4,77.7],"en":"Hey, you know, if you want,"},{"t":[77.7,79.5],"en":"I'm sure I could get Arnie on board."},{"t":[79.5,81.1],"en":"You wanted to join us for Suck It."},{"t":[83.1,84.2],"en":"Work together again."},{"t":[84.2,86],"en":"- The what?"},{"t":[86,87.4],"en":"- Suck It, that's what it's called."},{"t":[87.4,88.8],"en":"- Oh, okay."},{"t":[88.8,89.9],"en":"- Huh, catchy."},{"t":[89.9,91.6],"en":"Kids will love it, I get it."},{"t":[91.6,92.4],"en":"- There are very few things"},{"t":[92.4,95.2],"en":"that would make me not want to team up with David Wallace."},{"t":[95.2,97.2],"en":"And Suck It is one of them."},{"t":[99.5,100.4],"en":"See you later."},{"t":[100.4,101.3],"en":"- Oh, Michael."},{"t":[101.3,102.3],"en":"- I know."},{"t":[102.3,103.1],"en":"- Thank you for coming."},{"t":[103.1,104.6],"en":"- Thanks for having me."},{"t":[104.6,106.9],"en":"Well, that's not the David Wallace."},{"t":[106.9,111.9],"en":"I remember that there's some sort of weird creature"},{"t":[114.2,116],"en":"that lives in David Wallace's house."},{"t":[117.2,118.8],"en":"Oh, my God."},{"t":[119.8,120.6],"en":"All right."},{"t":[121.5,122.7],"en":"Get me out of here."},{"t":[128.3,131.3],"en":"- Well, it's a mess, what a mess."},{"t":[131.3,133.6],"en":"What you gonna do?"},{"t":[133.6,136.6],"en":"You're gonna take out your Suck It and your Suck It."},{"t":[136.6,137.9],"en":"Suck It, yeah."},{"t":[137.9,139.4],"en":"Take out your Suck It and your Suck It."},{"t":[139.4,140.6],"en":"Suck It!"},{"t":[140.6,141.3],"en":"- Suck It!"},{"t":[141.3,141.8],"en":"- Yeah!"},{"t":[141.8,142.4],"en":"- Suck It!"},{"t":[142.4,143.2],"en":"- Yeah!"},{"t":[143.2,144.1],"en":"- Suck It!"},{"t":[144.1,144.9],"en":"- Yeah!"},{"t":[144.9,146],"en":"- Suck It!"},{"t":[146,146.8],"en":"- Yeah!"},{"t":[146.8,147.7],"en":"- Suck It!"},{"t":[147.7,148.5],"en":"- Yeah!"},{"t":[148.5,149.4],"en":"- Suck It!"},{"t":[149.4,